    ],
    "text": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<h3>About IEI</h3>\r\n<p>IEI Technology USA Corp. is a leading provider of industrial computing solutions, specializing in high-performance, application-ready systems for industrial automation, network infrastructure, and medical applications. Our products are engineered to optimize smart manufacturing, process control, security systems, networking appliances, national defense, transportation, telecommunications, edge medical technology, and intelligent solutions such as AI and IoT.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Evolving from industrial PCs to advanced AI and edge computing technologies, IEI delivers complete intelligent systems that integrate hardware, software, cloud services, and data security. Designed for long-term reliability, seamless integration, and compliance with industry standards, our solutions are trusted in mission-critical environments worldwide.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Supported by global R&amp;D resources and U.S.-based technical teams, IEI is a trusted partner for OEMs and system integrators - helping customers accelerate innovation, enhance operational efficiency, and maintain a competitive edge, while advancing IoT and AI to create smarter, safer, and more connected living spaces.</span></p>\r\n",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
     "textIsRich": "true"
    }
   },
