       "table": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text": "<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><th>Category</th><th>Description &amp; Key Examples</th></tr><tr><td width=\"25%\"><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-networking-servers/\">Networking &amp; Servers</a></td><td>GRAND storage (1U–3U, 10 GbE, RAID); Mustang-QA100 (QAT accelerator); PUZZLE appliances (desktop → rack, various CPUs)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-embedded-computers-built-for-industry/\">Embedded Computer</a></td><td>SBCs (full &amp; half-size, PICOe), Backplanes, Industrial motherboards (ATX/Mini-ITX)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-embedded-systems/\">Embedded System</a></td><td>TANK/ECW box PCs (modular, rugged), DRPC DIN-rail systems, IDS signage players</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-panel-pc-and-monitors/\">Panel PC &amp; Monitors</a></td><td>7″–24″ panel PCs (Core/Celeron, glove touch), rugged monitors (vibration, dust/water-proof)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-medical-computers-and-odm/\">Medical Computers &amp; ODM</a></td><td>POCi, POCm, IASO, HTB (AI diagnostics), EndoCap (video capture for endoscopy)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-aiot-edge-computing/\">AIoT &amp; Edge Computing</a></td><td>Support for AI accelerators, GPUs, and industry-leading toolkits, scalable performance for AI workloads and IoT connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-advanced-video-solutions/\">Advanced Video Solutions</a></td><td>Medical imaging, broadcasting, surveillance, and AI-driven video analytics, with hardware optimized for low latency, multi-stream input, long-term reliability, and seamless integration into professional video workflows</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-support-categories/\">Support Categories</a></td><td>PSUs, Peripherals, Software, ePaper (new) through integrated catalog and resource system</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<p>For additional IEI product information, <a href=\"/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/iei/iei-product-guide-2025.pdf\">download the 2025 IEI Product Guide</a>.</p>\r\n",
